<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Macro for selling drugs AFK in CnR FiveM Server</Major>
    <Description>Go to a drug spot and activate the macro. It will sell drugs for you while AFK.
Recommended stock for a night run (6-8h): 300g - 500g each drug.
Try to go to the US 2 server, less cops and less risk in general.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 28 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyUp 28 1
Delay 1000 ms
Goto 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>